    "detailed_description": "A young woman sees her lost brother in her dreams. His calls for help lead her to a mysterious and magical factory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHAZMAT MAGIC is a cute-2d-pixelart-puzzle-platformer about mixing hazardous materials as a bumbling new employee at a magical chemical factory! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Mix colorful chemicals to unlock powers like super jumps and grapple beams!<br />\r\n- Use your knowledge of magical chemistry to solve whacky puzzles!<br />\r\n- Uncover the mysteries of Hazmat Magic Inc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Hazmat Magic Inc., Your value-added source for non-kinetic solids, super-jump compounds, and anti-gravity solutions, ideal for magic manufacturing and general wizardry.&quot;",
    "about_the_game": "A young woman sees her lost brother in her dreams. His calls for help lead her to a mysterious and magical factory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHAZMAT MAGIC is a cute-2d-pixelart-puzzle-platformer about mixing hazardous materials as a bumbling new employee at a magical chemical factory! <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Mix colorful chemicals to unlock powers like super jumps and grapple beams!<br />\r\n- Use your knowledge of magical chemistry to solve whacky puzzles!<br />\r\n- Uncover the mysteries of Hazmat Magic Inc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Hazmat Magic Inc., Your value-added source for non-kinetic solids, super-jump compounds, and anti-gravity solutions, ideal for magic manufacturing and general wizardry.&quot;",
